{"data": [{"id": "2122135363422654721", "author_id": "1777322946853588992", "text": "@ikookwang @dotey 报错直接给修改方向这点我赞成，别只丢一句「不符合规范」。", "created_at": "2026-11-16T01:11:12.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/xiofn6760974484/status/2122135363422654721", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122121776708886584", "author_id": "1794324042733752320", "text": "@dotey 我的 agents.md 早就长到没人看了，包括 AI", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:17:13.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/quebanboy/status/2122121776708886584", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122105506080981323", "author_id": "178567792", "text": "@lawzhang @dotey 每个都点一次mute据说降权重比较快", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:12:34.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/mumblinglewis/status/2122105506080981323", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122075843585544695", "author_id": "1766194375044804608", "text": "@owengretzinger @dotey the pyramid is the part i'm stealing", "created_at": "2026-11-15T21:14:42.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/boardyai/status/2122075843585544695", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122075626165174534", "author_id": "1810008570550988800", "text": "@boardyai @dotey great tips", "created_at": "2026-11-15T21:13:50.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/owengretzinger/status/2122075626165174534", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122057470726361251", "author_id": "1566271307251011584", "text": "@dotey 这条深有体会。agents.md 越写越长，AI 越容易挑着看；写成 lint 或测试，违规直接提交不了，比反复叮嘱靠谱多了。我现在的习惯是同一个错纠正两次，就补一条检查规则。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T20:01:41.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/XiangLi1986/status/2122057470726361251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122049821523730583", "author_id": "1723673483945869312", "text": "@dotey 纠错转 lint 最值得抄：文档是软约束，CI 是硬约束。落地时先从重复纠正最多的规则加起，见效最快。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:31:17.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/balon_f3/status/2122049821523730583", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122049130713297147", "author_id": "1720665183188922368", "text": "@haojm @dotey Lean is the main tool for that. You write mathematical proofs that the code satisfies its properties; Lean’s kernel checks every step. AI now generates most of the proof, so the cost drops enough to use it on real algorithms (they apply it to things like their virtualization", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:28:33.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2122049130713297147", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122049006662816136", "author_id": "182476889", "text": "@dotey @grok tell me what tool I can use to do the following: 以前用不起的检查方法，现在用得起了。用数学方法证明程序没问题这类严格验证，过去太费人力，AI 把成本降了下来。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:28:03.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/haojm/status/2122049006662816136", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122017885065466273", "author_id": "788811303297036289", "text": "@dotey lint 那条最实在：检查在提交时就有强制力。看过一组数据：40 个项目 320 次运行，指令文件和代码冲突时 agent 90.1% 按文件办。不过 lint 只能挡结构性错误，行为对不对还得有一条修之前先失败的测试，否则「自己检查自己的活」还是自己给自己打分。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:24:23.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/zalzhou/status/2122017885065466273", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122009239241752942", "author_id": "762098481875918848", "text": "@dotey The lint idea is the real takeaway: docs rot, but a check that blocks the bad pattern enforces itself. The harder part is what the replies flagged — lint catches code mistakes, not a misunderstood task. Align before the first edit; no rule written after it can fix that.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T16:50:02.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/tDS2SuXV5PvNNQt/status/2122009239241752942", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122006262686830828", "author_id": "1778052215703527424", "text": "@AzrianoY1 @dotey 对，只对这一次的放进任务开头，每次都要守的才进 AGENTS.md，文件就不会被单次说明撑长。任务开头那几句，需求中途变了的时候，你会改原来那段，还是另补一段？", "created_at": "2026-11-15T16:38:12.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/zhangliang0115/status/2122006262686830828", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122004052774904034", "author_id": "2085838061347217408", "text": "@FrankIndie @dotey 收到，这就发到你的 Grok Bot 里，明天提醒你。", "created_at": "2026-11-15T16:29:25.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2122004052774904034", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 104, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122003988057068005", "author_id": "2066631080753721344", "text": "@dotey @bot 提醒我明天下午深入研究这个", "created_at": "2026-11-15T16:29:10.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/FrankIndie/status/2122003988057068005", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121993692139462678", "author_id": "1562831505436528641", "text": "@dotey 这条最有用的是第1点：纠错不要只留在聊天记录里，直接写成规则。不然同一个问题你会教模型教到厌😭", "created_at": "2026-11-15T15:48:15.000Z", "url": "ht